<title>CANADA: CBRS reviewing Talisman, Wascana.</title>
<headline>CBRS reviewing Talisman, Wascana.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service said on Thursday it placed the ratings of Talisman Energy Inc and Wascana Energy Inc under review following Talisman's C$1.7 billion cash-and-stock takeover offer for Wascana.</p>
<p>Prior to the rating review, Talisman's commercial paper, medium-term notes and unsecured debentures and shelf registration were rated by CBRS at A-1, A and A, respectively. Wascana's senior notes and long-term debt were rated at B++ by the bond rating service.</p>
</text>
